WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.373 --> 00:00:18.493
Jan looked thoughtful.

2
00:00:18.513 --> 00:00:25.397
"If an experienced kid successfully rides Sunny, maybe Jon will consider keeping him.

3
00:00:26.338 --> 00:00:29.260
So, Daisy, let's have you ride Sunny during the lesson.

4
00:00:30.168 --> 00:00:33.471
We'll switch to an older horse for you for the trail ride."

5
00:00:34.612 --> 00:00:37.115
Daisy still felt guilty for lying to Jan.

6
00:00:37.575 --> 00:00:39.457
But she was excited to ride Sunny.

7
00:00:39.477 --> 00:00:42.200
"Thanks, Jan," she said.

8
00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:46.824
Then she whispered to Sunny, "I'm actually not very experienced.

9
00:00:47.364 --> 00:00:50.788
But I can talk to you, so that's just as good, right?"

10
00:00:50.808 --> 00:00:52.790
"Sure," Sunny said.

11
00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:53.931
"We'll have fun!"

12
00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:05.633
Jan showed Grace how to brush Blossom and put on her saddle.

13
00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:14.083
Daisy watched carefully, copying what Jan did.

14
00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.460
"Is this okay, Sunny?"

15
00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:35.701
she whispered, setting a saddle on Sunny's back.

16
00:01:35.721 --> 00:01:37.582
"Yep," he said.

17
00:01:37.602 --> 00:01:42.203
"Hey, Daisy, do you think they'll send me back?

18
00:01:43.264 --> 00:01:44.684
I don't like the dealer's farm.

19
00:01:45.564 --> 00:01:47.865
It's crowded, and the other horses steal my hay."

20
00:01:47.885 --> 00:01:53.006
"If you're very good today, Jan and Jon might let you stay," Daisy whispered.

21
00:01:53.026 --> 00:01:55.647
"I'll do my best!"

22
00:01:56.788 --> 00:01:57.668
Sunny snorted.

23
00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:02.261
"Hey, there's a bird!

24
00:02:02.741 --> 00:02:03.641
I want to race it!"

25
00:02:04.222 --> 00:02:07.003
He lunged toward it, tugging against his tie.

26
00:02:07.023 --> 00:02:08.904
"Sunny, no!"

27
00:02:09.185 --> 00:02:10.025
Daisy whispered.

28
00:02:10.045 --> 00:02:12.286
"You have to be good, remember?"

29
00:02:12.306 --> 00:02:14.528
"Oops, sorry!"

30
00:02:15.008 --> 00:02:15.688
Sunny said.

31
00:02:20.891 --> 00:02:22.933
Jan started the girls' riding lesson.

32
00:02:22.953 --> 00:02:28.556
"We talk to the horse using our aids," she said.

33
00:02:29.224 --> 00:02:32.846
"Your aids are your legs, your hands, and your voice."

34
00:02:32.866 --> 00:02:34.687
"My voice?"

35
00:02:35.107 --> 00:02:35.728
Grace said.

36
00:02:36.268 --> 00:02:37.189
Jan smiled.

37
00:02:37.209 --> 00:02:40.070
"Yes. Horses know some words."

38
00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:42.011
"That's for sure!"

39
00:02:42.451 --> 00:02:43.172
Daisy thought.

40
00:02:43.192 --> 00:02:45.993
"Especially when I'm talking to them!"

41
00:02:46.013 --> 00:02:50.136
"Daisy, why don't you demonstrate your aids?"

42
00:02:50.576 --> 00:02:51.216
Jan said.

43
00:02:51.236 --> 00:02:52.737
"Watch her, Grace.

44
00:02:54.438 --> 00:02:57.720
Daisy will squeeze her legs to ask Sunny to walk.

45
00:02:58.932 --> 00:03:02.855
She'll also make sure she's not pulling on the reins, because that means stop."

46
00:03:05.477 --> 00:03:08.240
Daisy squeezed her legs against Sunny's sides.

47
00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:09.981
"Please walk."

48
00:03:11.762 --> 00:03:12.943
Sunny started walking.

49
00:03:12.963 --> 00:03:15.245
"How's this, Daisy?

50
00:03:15.866 --> 00:03:17.767
I want to be good so I don't have to leave the farm."

51
00:03:17.787 --> 00:03:20.750
"You're doing great," Daisy whispered.

52
00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:21.851
"You too!"

53
00:03:22.251 --> 00:03:22.971
Sunny said.

54
00:03:25.353 --> 00:03:28.316
Luckily Jan focused mostly on Grace after that.

55
00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:33.102
Daisy was able to whisper what she wanted to Sunny.

56
00:03:33.963 --> 00:03:37.186
She also tried to pay attention to what Jan was telling Grace.

57
00:03:37.206 --> 00:03:41.410
"Let's try a trot now," Jan said.

58
00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:45.433
"Daisy, ask Sunny to trot so Grace can watch."

59
00:03:46.554 --> 00:03:47.295
Daisy gulped.

60
00:03:47.855 --> 00:03:50.517
On her beach rides, the horses had only walked.

61
00:03:50.537 --> 00:03:53.760
"Um, can I use my voice aid?"

62
00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:55.141
"Of course!"

63
00:03:55.161 --> 00:03:58.024
"Trot, Sunny," Daisy called.

64
00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.881
Sunny started moving faster.

65
00:04:01.862 --> 00:04:05.624
It felt bouncy, and Daisy had to work hard to keep her balance.

66
00:04:05.644 --> 00:04:09.125
"Very good, Daisy," Jan called.

67
00:04:10.026 --> 00:04:11.387
"You can halt now."

68
00:04:11.407 --> 00:04:15.509
"Stop please, Sunny," Daisy whispered.

69
00:04:15.529 --> 00:04:17.090
"Do I have to?"

70
00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.250
Sunny said.

71
00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:21.392
"Walking and standing are so boring!"

72
00:04:21.412 --> 00:04:23.693
"Yes!" Daisy said.

73
00:04:24.514 --> 00:04:26.015
Finally Sunny stopped.

74
00:04:26.035 --> 00:04:29.221
"Well done," Jan called.

75
00:04:29.921 --> 00:04:32.063
"Grace, would you like to try a trot now?"

76
00:04:33.164 --> 00:04:34.205
Grace shook her head.

77
00:04:34.225 --> 00:04:37.708
"I'd rather just walk, if that's okay."

78
00:04:37.728 --> 00:04:40.350
"Of course," Jan said.

79
00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:42.952
"We'll only be walking on the trail anyway.

80
00:04:44.594 --> 00:04:45.975
Let's practice steering.

81
00:04:48.237 --> 00:04:54.722
Walk Blossom in a circle, like this Daisy was about to steer Sunny in a circle.

82
00:04:55.142 --> 00:04:56.744
But suddenly he snorted.

83
00:04:57.537 --> 00:04:58.339
"Hey, a cat!"

84
00:04:59.001 --> 00:05:02.331
The horse burst into motion, rushing toward the cat!
